H1 : chi = int s^{-1} dnu <= 1/lambda (uniform in (L,a));  m1^2 = inf supp nu;  M0 = 1
Phi=0 (Gaussian) => W_full = 0 => Delta_dyn = G''(0) = 1/chi   [ch18:28-31 + Q6:83-86]

